{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[show]啊，是之前帮我们驱赶魔物的契约者大人——！请问有什么可以效劳的吗！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉？啊，那个……我就是想问问，关于——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[show]问问！契约者大人想要问问题吗！任何本人可以回答的，请尽管问本人吧！[r][l]契约者大人，快问吧，快问问本人吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"bright":1,"transTime":100,"y":30,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"relativePos":true,"x":0},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":100,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"bright":1,"transTime":100,"y":-30,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"relativePos":true,"x":0},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哇——不要突然贴过来啊！{myName}，救我呀！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"那个，您知道这种种子吗？","tag":"tag_6"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[cm][show]咦，契约者大人手里的是……我们风车平野的特产麦种！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[show]这种麦子很挑环境，在外面的环境中长起来还不如普通麦种。[r][l]但只要生长在与风车平野这边类似土质的田里，就会长得颗粒饱满又密集。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[show]原来如此……契约者大人想种在遥远的草原上啊！[r][l]那里的土质和这里差别太多，如果超过种子的适应力，吸收不到足够的营养，[r]自然就没办法成活啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊……原来……是这样的吗……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[show]所以就需要肥料出场啦！契约者大人，请再多依靠本人一些吧！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"肥料……？","tag":"tag_11"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[cm][show]对，没错！[r][l]只要有肥料，既能给作物提供营养，又能改良土质，能达到事半功倍的效果呢！[r][l]制作起来也非常简单，只需要拿着本人的这些材料，拌上药浆草的草木灰就好！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"村姑勒妮","text":"[show]你身上还有药浆草吗？让本人来帮你处理一下吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"您好，请问……","script":"s_1_3_2"}